  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the tagine pot over medium heat",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and saute until fragrant",
    "Add the fish fillets and poach for 5 minutes on each side",
    "Add the chervil, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper, and stir gently",
    "Add the water and bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes",
    "Serve the fish hot, garnished with additional chervil if desired"
